    affected_surface: "options A-D, row III; source coverage",
    verdict: "revise",
    evidence: "All four options supply exactly 1/(a-6), a!=6. No mathematical proposition for this reduction differs across options; the answer is copyable with no judgment. General loss of written steps does not disclose this specific unassessed task."
  },
