    author_provisional_text_left_unchanged: true
  },
  capability_losses: [
    "All choice responses replace independently written algebraic procedures with recognition and cannot establish separately mastered bundled subtasks.",
    "309: independently producing either distribution or identity derivation is not established.",
    "312: independently discovering and writing four divisibility proofs is not established; valid integer-factor certificates are recognized/checked.",
    "313: selecting values does not certify independent use of the most reasonable evaluation method.",
    "320: independently written direction/function justifications are not established; C supplies a proposed witness that itself requires verification.",
    "321: no actual graph drawing or actual-graph recognition; plotting/scale, connected parabola, graphical legibility and independent full-graph construction are lost. Textual graph relationships and interval image remain.",
    "322: independently written rationality proofs and positivity justifications are not established; exact rational-value judgment remains.",
